Subject: [PATCH 10/11] radeon_hd: enable Polaris 11

Radeon RX 460/560 and Radeon Pro WX 4100/4130/4170 (DCE 11.2). Tested on
an RX 560 (1002:67ef) over HDMI up to 2560x1440@75.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01NqrEBcidivS5BSWVfbLqvu
